# RStudio / R session state
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RHistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.RDataTmp*

# Documents are kept alongside the repo, not in it
*.pptx
*.docx
*.pdf

# Figures belong in figures/ ; keep stray root-level renders out
/*.png

# Quarto/knitr render output — regenerate from the .qmd sources in analysis/
*_files/
/analysis/*.html
/analysis/math.html
/analysis/equations.html

# Stray device output from headless Rscript runs
Rplots.pdf

# Manuscript-revision working notes.
# The technical record of model changes belongs in the repo (see
# docs/spawn-timing.md); the manuscript-side breadcrumb trail - reviewer
# responses, document editing checklists, revision audit logs - does not.
# Those live alongside the manuscript in the project folder, not here.
MANUSCRIPT_*.md
REVISION_FINDINGS.md
OUTSTANDING_ITEMS.md
*_DISCLOSURE.md
revision_notes/
